			<div class="content" id="post-content-3954040">
									

<p>It's been what? Like 3 months or so? Well&#8230; hopefully this will be worth the wait. Season 2 of End of Death HERE WE COME!</p>
<p>Also, cool trivia thing, if you convert each digit of 4514 to a letter based off of its position in the alphabet, you'd get 4 = D, 5 = E, 1 = A, 4 = D. So really this is SCP-DEAD. :P</p>
<p>I'd like to thank all my critiquers: UraniumEmpire, DrChandra, Veieidaheimer, Croquembouche, Othellothecat, A Random Day, Trennderdios, and AnnRKiss.</p>
<p>Also the code for that little HTML collapsible is stolen from Kalinin's <a href="/scp-2888">SCP-2888</a>, so thanks for that!</p>
<p>Update: ok I ended up scrapping kal's code for a sexier version Croquembouche wrote, so thanks to both of you for the idea and implementation respectively.</p>
<p>Here's to the fear of forever. This is just the beginning, and the near is not nigh.</p>
